  "description": "Pokémon Cards Could Predict the Next Bear Market",
  "body_html": "<p>Watch the video… tell me, do you think it is crazy?</p><p>I certainly do not think Pokemon cards will go to $0, I was a childhood fan myself. There will always be demand. However, similarities between the NFT market and the Pokemon market are very similar. There is no justifiable reason why some of these Pokemon cards are priced at current day levels. This sector will pop…and my speculation it will be an early bear market signal to the traditional markets. </p><p>This is just something fun I am tracking. If I see the “Pokemon Index” pop, I will update it in the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a>. </strong></p><p>I will see everyone bright and early tomorrow, if you have questions, feel free to swing by the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/8aac3321-fed7-4dd4-a536-a9fb92d3e2bb\">Main Chat</a>. </strong></p><h4><strong>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack this 🔄, if you actually liked it. </strong></h4><p><strong>Thanks for stopping by!</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-weird-market-signal-im-watching?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-weird-market-signal-im-watching?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-weird-market-signal-im-watching?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p>",
